        {
          "id": "wzyq6fz28jsw",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "We have identified this issue across multiple regions, not just eu-west-3 as originally suspected. We are expanding the scope of efforts to bring affected projects back online.\n\nUsers can also resolve this, in most cases, on their own via a project restart. This can be performed from the <a href=\"https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/general\">dashboard</a> for your own projects at any time.",
