        {
          "id": "ytcv2sh5r6q7",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "We’ve identified that a recent change to the Postgres systemd service has a dependency on a prestart script.\nThis script is not present on some older projects, and when those projects restart, Postgres may fail to start successfully.\nThis can result in projects remaining offline.\nWe are working on a fix to restore service.\n\nIf you are running a version of Postgres older than 15.1.1.57, please avoid restarting your project until this issue is resolved.",
          "incident_id": "m9lv5ttn4bny",
